        'For CFG tasks, the separate BERT head predicts production tokens. Parsing validates each production and terminal yield before a tree is released. Arithmetic lowering verifies temporary definitions, operator arity, operand order and reconstruction of the AST expression. These guarantees concern the predicted formal objects. Correct interpretation of the original English still depends on the learned model and an appropriate evaluation reference.'
