        '<b>3) Auditable local evaluation.</b> Canonical language grouping, dataset fingerprints, per-case outcomes, validation-only promotion gates and a frozen wording comparison provide a traceable record. Failed candidates and small challenge results remain visible. More data is evaluated as a hypothesis, not an automatic improvement.',
