        H('V. DATASETS AND PROVENANCE'),S('A. External Sources'),
        'The downloaded pretrained artifact is google-bert/bert-base-uncased [10], pinned to revision 86b5e0934494bd15c9632b12f734a8a67f723594. BookCorpus and English Wikipedia are inherited pretraining sources described by the model card; the project did not download or retrain on those raw corpora. The source artifact license is Apache-2.0.',
        'The external supervised source is the KB13 description/regex mirror in DeepRegex [9], pinned to revision 096490db7f4b0394fbb46b914cb35a0aa1cba29c. Of 824 paired rows, 55 pass local import restrictions; 497 use unsupported regex dialect, 271 become constant languages after binary restriction and one exceeds a repeat bound. Deduplication leaves 47 public-regex rows in the V3 corpus. The supplied dataset license is MIT. These figures describe this import, not original benchmark coverage.'
