        'Optional Manim rendering requires sealed DFA equivalence evidence or a production-checked tree. It rechecks evidence and reconstructs traces before rendering. An unverified preview remains an SVG inspection view. This maintains a meaningful distinction between a view that helps diagnose a prediction and an exported animation backed by the required formal evidence.'
