        'The mixed challenge reserved test has 23 DFA requests, of which seven are correct under the direct model. Two targets require nine states and exceed the original eight-state output space. The small subset score illustrates a broad wording gap; it should not be conflated with V3\'s generated-test score. Subsequent plan training uses eligible retired-development data only, so v1 is no longer described as an untouched evaluation source.',
        'The grammar decoder was improved from an initial feature-pooling pilot to a cross-attention production decoder and then a robust wording condition. The pilot and final results are separate model conditions. The robust model\'s generated-test exactness is strong, but CFG challenge accuracy of 10/14 is a more cautious indicator of wording sensitivity. Exact canonical productions also do not measure all semantically equivalent alternative grammars.',
