        'The full fresh set includes 63 cases outside the matched direct-model scope. Improvements on those cases partly reflect the new formal output capacity. The 57-case matched subset provides the fairer supported-scope comparison. The large difference on that subset is promising, but its small generated sample and shared operator catalogue limit generalization claims.',
