        'Fresh operator results include exact words 23/23, substring 21/21, prefix 20/22 and suffix only 1/18. In the matched subset, 35 cases improve and one regresses; three remain correct and 18 remain wrong. The suffix weakness is retained as a test finding and is not repaired by training against this now-exposed test.',
        'The new system improves correctness and reduces trainable parameters in this experiment. Its measured prediction latency is higher on the reported test sets. Formal plan search and exact compilation add work, so the correct interpretation is lower adaptation cost and better measured semantics, with a small local response-time cost. A future performance optimization must preserve the same semantic tests.',
